<title>GERMANY: German Kugelfischer sees higher profits.</title>
<headline>German Kugelfischer sees higher profits.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German ballbearing manufacturer FAG Kugelfischer Georg Schaefer KGaA said on Thursday it intended to increase its profit over the 1996 level and was looking at a mid-term level of more than 200 million marks in pre-tax profit.  </p>
<p>The group said earlier this month it expected 1996 group operating profit to increase to about 160 million marks from 136 million the year before.</p>
<p>Kugelfischer said higher output and an improved business environment should help raise profits.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
